<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (CFW had run Amazon and Google Ads campaigns for years with significant monthly investment, yet sales had flatlined. Campaigns were built around broad keywords that generated traffic without conversions, and nothing connected their Amazon and Google presence. The result was a cycle of rising spend against flat revenue, market share lost to competitors, and diminishing confidence that paid advertising could work at all. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
