<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (Both the Google and Amazon accounts were rebuilt from scratch. Google campaigns moved to a category-Pmax structure with tightly themed ad groups allowing for individual budget control; Amazon Sponsored Products were separated by product category, each with its own bid strategy. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
389 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (Conversion-optimised listings, built sponsored product campaigns targeting high-converting long-tail keywords, Sponsored Brands for top-of-search visibility, defensive campaigns protecting branded terms, negative keyword lists and ROAS-based bidding. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [25]
>>
endobj
